      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just rigged a skirt sweater and it was incredibely painful to get it to look right in most normal scenarios. There is, and always will be, issues with clipping with the spheric shape, unless you surround the whole thing with tens or hundreds of bones.\n\nWould love to see shapes or at least an alternate box that also comes with separate height and width values, instead of just the radius we got for spheric.\n\nE*: Since it's gonna come up, angle limits are NOT the solution! They help, yes, but:\n\na) the spheric nature of the bones will make them roll/rotate away in a way you wouldn't want them to unless, again, you had way too many bones.\n\nb) settin angle limits for e.g. hair or a cape to not clip through the body always comes with them sticking out like a sore thumb as soon as your head or chest is rotating the other direction.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-31T11:57:24.856Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like the hit detection of PhysBone to be box-shaped.\n\nWith the current Collider, there's always a problem of penetration when creating skirts or coats that spread out. Also, setting it too large results in it constantly colliding with the legs.\n\nWhile it's possible to mitigate this issue by increasing the number of components or adjusting Collider settings, this would hinder compatibility with the Quest.\n\nSo, I'd appreciate a solution where the Collider could have a separate thickness setting, providing a shape that is difficult to penetrate yet fits snugly around the legs, rather than a capsule-like shape.\n\n※This text was prepared by ChatGPT, so I apologize for any misinterpretations.\n\nThe original text is posted below.\n\nPhysBoneの当たり判定をBox型にできるようにしてほしいです。\n\n現在のColliderではスカートやコートを作る際にどうしても広がったときに隙間から貫通してしまいます。なおかつ大きく設定すると常に足に当たってしまいます。\n\nComponentの数を増やしたり、Colliderの設定を増やしたりすればなんとか対策は可能ですが、今度はQuest対応ができなくなってしまいます。\n\nなので、なるべく貫通し難く尚且つ足とかに当たったときに隙間なく当たってくれるようなカプセルのような形ではなく厚みを別で設定できるような形にしてほしいです。",
